<title>JAPAN: Nichiei Finance says to file for liquidation.</title>
<headline>Nichiei Finance says to file for liquidation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichiei Finance Co Ltd said that it would file for liquidation with the Yokohama District Court as early as on Tuesday, and plans to hold a news conference at 8.30 a.m. (2330 GMT Monday).</p>
</text>
